#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:5 4566beaa482f40b09d2e844a630e9d85
msgid "Automatic Takeoff"
msgstr "自动起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:7 b574be470608481f8a4afa13db30b1ea
msgid ""
"Plane can automatically takeoff in AUTO modee a wide range of aircraft "
"types. The instructions below will teach you how to setup your mission to "
"support automatic takeoff. Automatic takeoff can also be accomplished by the"
" :ref:`takeoff-mode`."
msgstr ""
"Plane 可以在 AUTO 模式下对多种飞机类型自动起飞。以下说明将教您如何设置任务以支持自动起飞。自动起飞也可通过 :ref:`takeoff-"
"mode` 完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:12 c669baa31919426e9006e176f5c73c7f
msgid "Basic Instructions"
msgstr "基本说明"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:14 6840a83528ec4440aef1ac7a45bb630b
msgid ""
"To cause the plane to execute a takeoff, add a NAV_TAKEOFF command to your "
"mission, usually as the first command. There are two parameters to this "
"command - the minimum ``pitch``, and the takeoff altitude. The minimum pitch"
" controls how steeply the aircraft will climb, at a minimum, during the "
"takeoff. A value of between 10 and 15 degrees is recommended for most "
"aircraft. The takeoff ``altitude`` controls the altitude above home at which"
" the takeoff is considered complete. Make sure that this is high enough that"
" the aircraft can safely turn after takeoff. An altitude of 40 meters is "
"good for a wide range of aircraft. After the takeoff is complete, the "
"mission will move to the next mission item, or, if there are none, switch to"
" RTL mode."
msgstr ""
"要使飞机执行起飞，请在任务中添加 NAV_TAKEOFF 命令，通常作为第一条命令。该命令有两个参数——最小 ``pitch`` "
"和起飞高度。最小俯仰控制飞机在起飞期间的最小爬升坡度，大多数飞机推荐值为10至15度之间。起飞 ``altitude`` 控制起飞完成时距 Home "
"的高度。请确保该值足够高，使飞机在起飞后能够安全转弯。40米的高度适用于多种飞机。起飞完成后，任务将进入下一个任务项，如果没有，则切换到 RTL 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:24 45ca9cb9d0ee47d780cd935a95d85b6d
msgid ""
"During takeoff the wings will be held level to within :ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT"
" <LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>` degrees until :ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>` (10m "
"by default) meters of altitude is reached, gradually allowing more roll "
"until the normal :ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` limit is allowed once"
" 3x :ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>` meters of altitude is reached. This "
"prevents a sharp roll from causing the wings to hit the runway for ground "
"takeoffs."
msgstr ""
"起飞期间，机翼将保持在 :ref:`LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT <LEVEL_ROLL_LIMIT>` 度以内水平，直到达到 "
":ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>`（默认10米）高度，之后逐渐允许更多横滚，直至达到3倍 "
":ref:`TKOFF_LVL_ALT<TKOFF_LVL_ALT>` 高度时允许正常的 "
":ref:`ROLL_LIMIT_DEG<ROLL_LIMIT_DEG>` 限制。这可以防止地面起飞时因急剧横滚导致机翼碰到跑道。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:30 821aa8eca55c46d7b0674d8399b53c7b
msgid ""
"Note that the takeoff direction is set from the direction the plane is "
"pointing when the automatic takeoff command is started, if a compass is "
"used, or the heading once a valid GPS heading is obtained with sufficient "
"ground speed. So you need to point the plane in the right direction, then "
"switch to AUTO mode. During the first stage of the takeoff the autopilot "
"will use the gyroscope as the principal mechanism for keeping the aircraft "
"flying straight, or the compass if equipped. After sufficient speed for a "
"good GPS heading is reached the aircraft will switch to using the GPS ground"
" track if not using compass, or the initial compass heading which allows it "
"to account for a cross-wind."
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果使用罗盘，起飞方向由自动起飞命令开始时飞机所指方向决定；否则由获得足够地速后的有效 GPS "
"航向决定。因此，您需要将飞机对准正确方向，然后切换到 AUTO "
"模式。起飞第一阶段，飞控将使用陀螺仪作为保持飞机直线飞行的主要机制，如有罗盘则使用罗盘。达到足够地速获得良好 GPS "
"航向后，如果不使用罗盘，飞机将切换到使用 GPS 地轨；如果使用罗盘，则使用初始罗盘航向，可以应对侧风。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:39 533401ef98764d55a8daaf9b3dd365ac
msgid "You should try to launch into the wind whenever possible."
msgstr "尽可能逆风起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:41 e82d4780b2c14e1b9ab7d131aff89169
msgid ""
"By default, the throttle will be set at :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` "
"during all of the climb. For more fine-grained control, please read "
":ref:`takeoff-throttle`."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，整个爬升过程中油门将设置为 :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>`。如需更精细的控制，请阅读 "
":ref:`takeoff-throttle`。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:45 cc69fb70f1a24b8a83343b67cab4e9e0
msgid "Hand Launching"
msgstr "手抛起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:47 7e24406c9fc54ed594ac38c3aa9302a6
msgid ""
"A hand launch is a common method to launch smaller aircraft, such as foam "
"gliders. Plane has a number of parameters that control how a hand launch is "
"done. If you are planning to hand launch your aircraft in AUTO mode then "
"please look through these options carefully."
msgstr ""
"手抛起飞是发射小型飞机（如泡沫滑翔机）的常用方法。Plane 有多个参数控制手抛起飞的方式。如果计划在 AUTO 模式下手抛飞机，请仔细查阅这些选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:52 8d9c7cba23b147ff9f6aaebfc7c1483b
msgid "The keys to a good hand launch are:"
msgstr "良好手抛起飞的关键："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:54 ccb9b81ab6004ad0937cb75edb367beb
msgid ""
"if the propeller is behind your hand during launch then ensuring that the "
"motor does not start until it is past your hand"
msgstr "如果发射时螺旋桨在您手后，确保电机在螺旋桨通过手部后才启动"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:56 78cfea9e5d9d40778e6424bb2792dc7e
msgid "ensuring that the aircraft does not try to climb out too steeply"
msgstr "确保飞机不会试图爬升过陡"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:57 8e628fd5cd784f0ebc69efad370bed76
msgid ""
"assuring that the parameters are set to actually start the motor after the "
"vehicle leaves your hand"
msgstr "确保参数设置为飞行器离手后确实启动电机"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:59 aa9dfa81357f46ae85678029a6284700
msgid ""
"default values for the following parameters will usually start the motor as "
"soon as takeoff is selected (mode or mission item). This may be fine for "
"certain hand launch situations/vehicles, but adjusting the following "
"parameters to non-default values may be needed for safety in other "
"situations."
msgstr ""
"以下参数的默认值通常会在选择起飞（模式或任务项）后立即启动电机。这在某些手抛情况/飞行器中可能没问题，但在其他情况下，出于安全考虑可能需要将以下参数调整为非默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:61 f2500ad819354e449a9a232fa71ed32f
msgid "The main parameters that control the hand launch motor start are:"
msgstr "控制手抛电机启动的主要参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:63 59750ef7fdab46c78a4ce2980ea6b46f
msgid ":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC <TKOFF_THR_MINACC>`"
msgstr ":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC <TKOFF_THR_MINACC>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:64 cdf242870fbe413eae143072a3e00d09
msgid ":ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY <TKOFF_THR_DELAY>`"
msgstr ":ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY <TKOFF_THR_DELAY>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:65 049009eca6304e5584d4429786c30cba
msgid ":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINSPD <TKOFF_THR_MINSPD>`"
msgstr ":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINSPD <TKOFF_THR_MINSPD>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:66
#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:163
#: 99f92cdb04d8445daa3a624f0e792f30 9c90b2643e7d41aa8b8a7671a3167f2e
msgid ":ref:`TECS_PITCH_MAX <TECS_PITCH_MAX>`"
msgstr ":ref:`TECS_PITCH_MAX <TECS_PITCH_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:68 2b4910033808467da29123c543167816
msgid ""
"When the auto takeoff mission command starts (usually by switching to AUTO "
"mode) or you switch to TAKEOFF mode when armed, the autopilot starts in "
"\"throttle suppressed\" mode. The throttle will not start until the "
"conditions set by the ``TKOFF_THR_x`` parameters are met."
msgstr ""
"当自动起飞任务命令开始（通常通过切换到 AUTO 模式）或在解锁状态下切换到 TAKEOFF 模式时，飞控进入「油门抑制」模式。在满足 "
"``TKOFF_THR_x`` 参数设定的条件之前，油门不会启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:73 a56bc3e1681f4c32b857ba67138163fb
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC <TKOFF_THR_MINACC>` parameter controls the "
"minimum forward acceleration of the aircraft before the throttle will "
"engage. The forward acceleration comes from the throwing action of your arm "
"as you launch the aircraft. You need to set this value high enough that the "
"motor won't start automatically when you are carrying the aircraft normally,"
" but low enough that you can reliably trigger the acceleration with a normal"
" throwing action. A value of around 15 m/s/s is good for most aircraft. The "
"default value is 0, meaning this safeguard is not active."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC <TKOFF_THR_MINACC>` "
"参数控制油门接合前飞机所需的最小前向加速度。前向加速度来自手抛飞机时手臂的投掷动作。您需要将该值设置得足够高，使电机在您正常携带飞机时不会自动启动，但又足够低以确保正常投掷动作能可靠触发加速度。约15"
" m/s/s 的值对大多数飞机效果良好。默认值为0，表示该保护未激活。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:82 d7064cdc6acc4fccb55631cfa84a78d6
msgid ""
"Sometimes it is desirable to require multiple \"shakes\" of the vehicle "
"above the :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC <TKOFF_THR_MINACC>` before allowing a motor"
" start. The :ref:`TKOFF_ACCEL_CNT<TKOFF_ACCEL_CNT>` parameter can be used to"
" require multiple events exceeding this acceleration before proceeding in "
"the motor start."
msgstr ""
"有时希望在允许电机启动前，要求飞行器超过 :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC <TKOFF_THR_MINACC>` 进行多次「摇晃」。可使用"
" :ref:`TKOFF_ACCEL_CNT<TKOFF_ACCEL_CNT>` 参数要求在继续电机启动前多次超过此加速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:84 6f14f1556fe34c86a9b40810062b8bb3
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY <TKOFF_THR_DELAY>` parameter is a delay in 1/10 of"
" a second units to hold off starting the motor after the minimum "
"acceleration or acceleration count is reached. This is meant to ensure that "
"the propeller is past your hand before the motor starts. A value of at least"
" 2 (which is 0.2 seconds and the default for the parameter) is recommended "
"for a hand launch. More may be needed."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY <TKOFF_THR_DELAY>` "
"参数是在达到最小加速度或加速计数后延迟启动电机的时间，单位为0.1秒。其目的是确保螺旋桨在电机启动前已通过您的手部。对于手抛，推荐至少设置为2（即0.2秒，该参数的默认值）。根据情况可能需要更长时间。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:90 1953aa47fae84e8684436b65dd5d1776
msgid ""
"The :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINSPD <TKOFF_THR_MINSPD>` parameter is a minimum ground"
" speed (as measured by the GPS) before the motor starts after the above "
"dealy. This is an additional safety measure to ensure the aircraft is out of"
" your hand before the motor starts. A value of 4m/s is a good starting point"
" if you wish this safety feature to be active. The default is 0, which would"
" allow the motor to start immediately after the above delay with most GPSes "
"since their velocity estimate is usually a bit  noisey."
msgstr ""
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINSPD <TKOFF_THR_MINSPD>` 参数是电机在上述延迟后启动所需的最小地速（由 GPS "
"测量）。这是确保飞机离手后才启动电机的附加安全措施。如果希望启用此安全功能，4m/s 是一个良好的起始值。默认值为0，这意味着大多数 GPS "
"在上述延迟后会立即允许电机启动，因为其速度估算通常存在一定噪声。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:95 b6c9a8e38e03443bb215d089bcb65cf7
msgid ""
"Note that if your aircraft is a \"tractor\" type with the motor at the front"
" then you may want to use the default values of :ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY "
"<TKOFF_THR_DELAY>` and :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINSPD <TKOFF_THR_MINSPD>`, or use "
"low values."
msgstr ""
"请注意，如果您的飞机是电机在前方的「拖拉机」型，您可能希望使用 :ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY <TKOFF_THR_DELAY>` 和 "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINSPD <TKOFF_THR_MINSPD>` 的默认值，或使用较低的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:98 1f2b496351384211a8b8da032e8f4aa5
msgid ""
"The final parameter you should think about is the :ref:`TECS_PITCH_MAX "
"<TECS_PITCH_MAX>` parameter. That controls the maximum pitch which the "
"autopilot will demand in auto flight. When set to a non-zero value this "
"replaces the :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG <PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` parameter for all "
"auto-throttle flight modes. Setting this parameter to a value which is small"
" enough to ensure the aircraft can climb reliably at full throttle will make"
" takeoff much more reliable. A value of 20 is good for most aircraft."
msgstr ""
"最后需要考虑的参数是 :ref:`TECS_PITCH_MAX "
"<TECS_PITCH_MAX>`。该参数控制飞控在自动飞行中要求的最大俯仰角。当设置为非零值时，它会替代 :ref:`PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG"
" <PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG>` "
"用于所有自动油门飞行模式。将此参数设置为足够小的值，以确保飞机能在满油门下可靠爬升，将使起飞更加可靠。对大多数飞机，20度是合适的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:106
#: b6c8a69c21ef4a61b422ca5034a62952
msgid ""
"Hand launching a plane usually requires that the vehicle leaves your hand at"
" zero degrees to 5 degs pitch. Higher pitches could lead to a stall. "
"ArduPilot will not start the motors if the pitch is greater than 40 degrees "
"or roll greater than 30 degrees from level. These limits should never be "
"approached when throwing the plane, but are provided as a safety gate."
msgstr ""
"手抛飞机通常要求飞行器离手时的俯仰角为0度至5度。更高的俯仰可能导致失速。ArduPilot "
"在俯仰超过40度或横滚超过水平30度时不会启动电机。投掷飞机时不应接近这些限制，但这些限制作为安全门槛是存在的。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:109
#: dcfaa3dd866b4df59a31d05f68d43d69
msgid "Catapult Launching"
msgstr "弹射起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:111
#: 677d24f789814b1487a033028aa5a2fd
msgid ""
"The main differences between catapult launching and hand launching is that a"
" catapult will usually give the aircraft a greater level of acceleration, "
"and the risk involved is primarily that the propeller will strike the "
"catapult frame instead of hitting your hand."
msgstr "弹射起飞与手抛起飞的主要区别在于，弹射器通常给飞机更大的加速度，主要风险是螺旋桨会撞击弹射架而非您的手部。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:116
#: 6eb0f663e2a144b0a0c7eba9d7f74ced
msgid ""
"In most other ways a catapult launch is like a hand launch, and the same 4 "
"key parameters apply. If your catapult is setup so that the motor cannot run"
" until the aircraft is out of the frame of the catapult then you will need "
"to choose the parameters to ensure there is sufficient delay. Often this "
"means a higher value for :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC <TKOFF_THR_MINACC>` (say "
"20m/s/s) and a longer delay before the GPS ground speed is measured. Some "
"experimentation may be needed, but a value of :ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY "
"<TKOFF_THR_DELAY>` of 5 is likely to be good for many catapults."
msgstr ""
"弹射起飞在大多数方面与手抛起飞类似，相同的4个关键参数同样适用。如果您的弹射器设置为在飞机离开弹射架之前不能运行电机，则需要选择参数以确保有足够的延迟。通常这意味着需要更高的"
" :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MINACC <TKOFF_THR_MINACC>` 值（例如20m/s/s）以及在 GPS "
"地速测量之前更长的延迟。可能需要一些试验，但 :ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY <TKOFF_THR_DELAY>` "
"值为5对许多弹射器可能是合适的。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:126
#: a15c9c0ba6584d5fa0a6e178beeac767
msgid "Bungee Launching"
msgstr "橡皮筋弹射起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:128
#: 71e90658d5cf4e369d7e0ad5de9d0be5
msgid ""
"A bungee launch uses a long piece of stretched elastic to launch the "
"aircraft. This can be a cheaper alternative to a catapult and gives good "
"results for a lot of small to medium sized models."
msgstr "橡皮筋起飞使用一段拉伸的弹性材料发射飞机。这可以是比弹射器更经济的替代方案，对许多小到中型模型效果良好。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:132
#: 64d0d29e808745c989948b3439ff1b79
msgid ""
"The same 4 parameters that apply to hand launch and catapult launch also "
"apply to a bungee launch, but the values you will need are different. The "
"main risk with a bungee launch (especially with a pusher propeller) is that "
"the propeller will strike the bungee cord, damaging either the propeller or "
"the bungee or both. To prevent this from happening you should have a much "
"higher value of :ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY <TKOFF_THR_DELAY>`, making it high "
"enough that the aircraft will have released the bungee before the motor "
"starts. A value of around 50 (giving a 5 second delay) may be a good "
"starting point."
msgstr ""
"手抛和弹射起飞适用的相同4个参数也适用于橡皮筋起飞，但所需值不同。橡皮筋起飞的主要风险（特别是对于推进式螺旋桨）是螺旋桨会打到橡皮筋，损坏螺旋桨或橡皮筋，或两者都损坏。为防止这种情况，应使用更高的"
" :ref:`TKOFF_THR_DELAY <TKOFF_THR_DELAY>` "
"值，使其高到足以让飞机在电机启动之前已经释放橡皮筋。约50的值（给出5秒延迟）可能是一个良好的起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:143
#: 1cb5f527ca074d33805421b073643c9a
msgid "Runway Takeoffs (CTOL)"
msgstr "跑道起飞（CTOL）"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:145
#: 7bc80b977fec4578aa749be0a8071000
msgid ""
"The final class of takeoff is runway takeoff, also known as wheeled takeoff "
"or CTOL (Conventional Takeoff and Landing). Setting up for a good automatic "
"takeoff from a runway is a bit more complex than the other types of launches"
" with more parameters to set and more tuning required. This type of launch "
"greatly benefits from the use of a compass onboard since initial heading is "
"critical."
msgstr ""
"最后一类起飞是跑道起飞，也称为轮式起飞或 "
"CTOL（常规起降）。设置从跑道良好自动起飞比其他类型的发射更为复杂，需要设置更多参数和更多调参工作。这类起飞非常受益于机载罗盘，因为初始航向至关重要。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:152
#: c46193829f144ba093d66bdf775899b4
msgid ""
"One key consideration with runway takeoffs is whether you have a tail "
"dragger (tail wheel steering) or tricycle undercarriage (nose wheel "
"steering). Automatic takeoff is easier with a tricycle undercarriage "
"aircraft, with a tail dragger needing additional parameters."
msgstr ""
"跑道起飞的一个关键考虑因素是您使用的是尾轮（后轮转向）还是三点式起落架（前轮转向）。三点式起落架飞机的自动起飞更容易，尾轮飞机需要额外的参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:157
#: 333173ade94a4912a6eb4a50a36f250a
msgid "The key parameters for runway takeoff are:"
msgstr "跑道起飞的关键参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-takeoff.rst:159
